  "id": "grilled-potato-salad",
  "name": "Grilled Potato Salad",
  "subtitle": "Charred potatoes with bacon, herbs, and tangy dressing",
  "description": "Grilled red potatoes are tossed with a smooth cider-vinegar dressing, bacon, green onions, and parsley for a warm, savory salad.",
